Pipeline Map (Current)
 
Data Workflow and Process
1.	Step 6 computes TIL profile context and line items.
2.	Information-only check runs first.
3.	If information-only is true, row is short-circuited (information_only_skip).
4.	Otherwise, template context is loaded for matched event via historical template mapping and Primavera task data.
5.	Template coverage LLM compares TIL line items (or metadata-only fallback) against template activities.
6.	Coverage result is returned with covered, gap, and unclear line-item partitions.
7.	If template is fully covered and no gaps, row short-circuits (template_covered_skip).
8.	Otherwise, only gap/net-new context proceeds to downstream evidence and applicability stages.
